ARTICLE / RESEARCH READER
=========================
DOM:
- #gw-report-reader full-stage overlay (backdrop + shell)
- #gw-report-reader-title
- Meta grid: #gw-reader-source, #gw-reader-date, #gw-reader-time,
  #gw-reader-domain, #gw-reader-coords, #gw-reader-layer
- Body: #gw-report-reader-body (15px, line-height 1.7, scroll)
- Footer: ID + external source link

JS:
- openGwReportReader(event|title, md?)
- formatArticleDateTime(raw) → { date, time, iso, display } de-DE
- Feed card click opens full reader (not tiny popup expand)
- Selection panel "READER" button
- Esc / backdrop close

CSS scale:
- shell width min(920px, 96%), max-height ~92% — research readable surface
